# More info: https://docs.docker.com/engine/reference/builder/#dockerignore-file
# Ignore everything by default and re-include only needed files
**

# Re-include the Go source trees by name: Podman/buildah do not
# recreate excluded directories from file patterns alone, so
# !**/*.go without these leaves the build context without cmd/,
# api/, internal/ and pkg/ (see the buildah issue referenced below).
# See https://github.com/containers/buildah/issues/6417
!api
!cmd
!internal
!pkg

# Re-include Go source files (but not *_test.go)
!**/*.go
**/*_test.go

# Re-include Go module files
!go.mod
!go.sum
